---
title: Start your financial journey
description: A three-stage guide to personal finance, investing and family protection in India.
keywords: [financial planning, investing, savings, insurance, India]
permalink: /en/start-here/index.html
language: en
stages:
  - id: beginner
    title: Foundation and family protection
    label: Beginner
    subtitle: Foundation & protection
    summary: Before investing, protect your income and family against unexpected financial setbacks. Start with emergency savings and high-interest debt.
    steps:
      - tag: Emergency fund
        title: Build an emergency fund
        description: Aim to save six to twelve months of essential household expenses in an accessible account or liquid fund for job loss, medical emergencies and other unexpected events.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Family emergency document kit, url: /en/articles/in-case-of-emergency-kit/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Emergency fund planner, url: /en/calculators/emergency-fund-planner.html, language: en }
          - { type: checklist, title: Family emergency documents checklist, url: /en/checklists/icoe-checklist.html, language: en }
      - tag: Debt management
        title: Pay off high-interest debt and build your credit score
        description: Prioritise credit-card balances and personal loans. Paying debts on time can help build a healthy credit score.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Credit-card strategies and traps, url: /en/articles/credit-card-optimization-and-traps/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Understanding your credit score, url: /en/articles/credit-score/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Credit-card payoff calculator, url: /en/calculators/credit-card-payoff-calculator.html, language: en }
      - tag: Insurance
        title: Consider term life and health insurance
        description: Review your family's needs for term life and health insurance separately from investments. Cover levels depend on your circumstances; compare policy terms and exclusions.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Insurance products in India, url: /en/articles/insurance-products-in-india/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Life insurance cover calculator, url: /en/calculators/life-insurance-sum-assured-calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Health insurance cover calculator, url: /en/calculators/medical-insurance-sum-assured-calculator.html, language: en }
      - tag: Savings
        title: Explore government savings schemes and bank deposits
        description: Consider PPF for eligible long-term savings and bank fixed or recurring deposits for shorter-term needs, taking account of access, tax and risks.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Banking and savings products, url: /en/articles/banking-and-savings-products-india/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: PPF calculator, url: /en/calculators/ppf_returns_calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: checklist, title: Personal finance fortification checklist, url: /en/checklists/personal-finance-fortification-checklist.html, language: en }
  - id: intermediate
    title: Growth and wealth accumulation
    label: Intermediate
    subtitle: Growth & investing
    summary: Once your foundation is stronger, explore investments suited to your goals, time horizon and risk tolerance.
    steps:
      - tag: Investment basics
        title: Understand inflation and set goals
        description: Consider how inflation can reduce purchasing power, then allocate assets with goals such as education, family needs and retirement in mind.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: How to start investing, url: /en/articles/how-to-start-investing/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: How to build an investment portfolio, url: /en/articles/portfolio-creation-approach/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Inflation calculator, url: /en/calculators/inflation-calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Goal-based investing calculator, url: /en/calculators/goal-based-investing-calculator.html, language: en }
      - tag: Mutual funds
        title: Explore index funds and direct plans
        description: Compare index and actively managed funds, direct and regular plans, costs and risks. A systematic investment plan can help you invest regularly, but returns are not guaranteed.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Index funds versus active mutual funds, url: /en/articles/index-funds-vs-active-mutual-funds/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Regular versus direct mutual funds, url: /en/articles/regular-vs-direct-mutual-funds/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Mutual fund SIP calculator, url: /en/calculators/mf_sip_calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: checklist, title: Index fund selection checklist, url: /en/checklists/index-fund-selection-checklist.html, language: en }
      - tag: Gold
        title: Compare gold investment options
        description: Understand the making charges, deductions and business risks of jewellery savings schemes. Compare these with options such as sovereign gold bonds and gold ETFs, including their risks and availability.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Gold investment options, url: /en/articles/gold-investing-options-india/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Risks of jewellery savings schemes, url: /en/articles/gold-chits-jeweller-gold-schemes/, language: en }
      - tag: Retirement
        title: Consider EPF, NPS and compounding
        description: Starting retirement savings early gives contributions more time to compound. Review EPF and NPS eligibility, tax rules and investment risks.
        resources:
          - { type: calculator, title: Retirement calculator, url: /en/calculators/retirement-calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: EPF calculator, url: /en/calculators/epf_calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Systematic withdrawal calculator, url: /en/calculators/mf_swp_calculator.html, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Annuity retirement plans, url: /en/articles/annuity-plans-guide-india/, language: en }
  - id: advanced
    title: Optimisation and succession
    label: Advanced
    subtitle: Diversification & succession
    summary: As your portfolio develops, consider international diversification, alternative assets and planning for the next generation.
    steps:
      - tag: International investing
        title: Explore international and direct equity investing
        description: Learn about investing in overseas shares, including through the Liberalised Remittance Scheme, and consider currency, market and tax risks.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Investing in foreign equities from India, url: /en/articles/investing-in-foreign-equity-from-india/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Introduction to equity investments, url: /en/articles/equity-investments-in-india/, language: en }
      - tag: Alternative investments
        title: Learn about REITs and InvITs
        description: Real estate and infrastructure investment trusts can provide exposure without directly buying a property or infrastructure asset. Their prices and distributions can vary.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: A guide to REITs, url: /en/articles/reit/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: A guide to InvITs, url: /en/articles/invit/, language: en }
      - tag: Debt versus investing
        title: Compare home-loan prepayment and investing
        description: Consider loan interest, potential investment returns, risk and peace of mind when deciding whether to prepay or invest.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: Home-loan prepayment versus equity investing, url: /en/articles/loan-prepayment-vs-equity-investment/, language: en }
          - { type: calculator, title: Home-loan EMI calculator, url: /en/calculators/home_loan_emi_calculator.html, language: en }
      - tag: Wills and succession
        title: Plan your will and succession
        description: Consider writing a will, updating nominees and reviewing property records so your family can manage your assets more easily.
        resources:
          - { type: article, title: The importance of writing a will, url: /en/articles/importance-of-writing-a-will/, language: en }
          - { type: article, title: Hidden risks of real estate investing, url: /en/articles/hidden-risks-of-real-estate-investments-india/, language: en }
          - { type: checklist, title: Estate planning checklist, url: /en/checklists/estate-planning-checklist.html, language: en }
---
<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
  <header class="directory-intro wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Learning path · A step-by-step financial guide</p>
    <h1>Start your financial journey here</h1>
    <p>Protect your family, build savings and then plan your investments. Choose the stage that fits your current circumstances. Resources marked Tamil have not yet been translated.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="roadmap-container wrap">
    <nav class="roadmap-nav" aria-label="Guide stages">
      {% for stage in stages %}
      <a href="#stage-{{ stage.id }}" class="roadmap-nav__item">
        <span class="roadmap-nav__num">{{ loop.index }}</span>
        <span class="roadmap-nav__text"><strong>{{ stage.label }}</strong><span>{{ stage.subtitle }}</span></span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>
    {% for stage in stages %}
    {% set stageNumber = loop.index %}
    <section class="roadmap-stage" id="stage-{{ stage.id }}" aria-labelledby="heading-{{ stage.id }}">
      <div class="roadmap-stage__header">
        <div class="roadmap-stage__badge roadmap-stage__badge--{{ stage.id }}">Stage {{ stageNumber }} · {{ stage.label }}</div>
        <h2 id="heading-{{ stage.id }}">{{ stage.title }}</h2>
        <p class="roadmap-stage__summary">{{ stage.summary }}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="roadmap-grid">
        {% for step in stage.steps %}
        <article class="roadmap-card">
          <div class="roadmap-card__top"><span class="roadmap-card__step">Step {{ stageNumber }}.{{ loop.index }}</span><span class="roadmap-card__tag">{{ step.tag }}</span></div>
          <h3>{{ step.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ step.description }}</p>
          <div class="roadmap-card__resources">
            <span class="roadmap-card__res-label">Recommended resources:</span>
            <ul class="roadmap-card__res-list">
              {% for resource in step.resources %}
              <li><span class="res-type res-type--{{ resource.type }}">{{ resource.type | capitalize }}</span> <a href="{{ resource.url | url }}" hreflang="{{ resource.language }}">{{ resource.title }}{% if resource.language == 'ta' %} (Tamil){% endif %} ↗</a></li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {% endfor %}
    <aside class="roadmap-summary-box" aria-labelledby="golden-rules-heading">
      <div class="roadmap-summary-box__inner">
        <h2 id="golden-rules-heading">Three principles to remember</h2>
        <div class="roadmap-summary-box__rules">
          <div class="roadmap-rule"><span class="roadmap-rule__num">1</span><div><h3>Build protection first</h3><p>Emergency savings and suitable life and health insurance can support your financial foundation.</p></div></div>
          <div class="roadmap-rule"><span class="roadmap-rule__num">2</span><div><h3>Understand costs</h3><p>Compare direct plans, index funds and expense ratios as well as risks and suitability.</p></div></div>
          <div class="roadmap-rule"><span class="roadmap-rule__num">3</span><div><h3>Stay disciplined</h3><p>A consistent investment plan can help you avoid making decisions based solely on market emotions.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</main>
